List and define Explorer View and Editor Tab Indicators (Git)

In the file explorer and on editor tabs, text colors and badges indicate the status of files relative to your source control repository

List and define Editor Gutter and Minimap Indicators (Git)

Small colored bars in the "gutter" (next to line numbers) and the minimap indicate changes within specific lines since the last commit

